"markdown": "### PrefNest\n\nReorganizes the Settings interface, grouping jailbreak tweaks and apps centrally. Especially on newer iOS versions (iOS 18 and later), where tweak preferences are often buried deep inside General settings, this tweak brings everything directly to the main Settings page for ultimate convenience.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/PrefNest/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
