"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/PrefNest/Screenshots/3.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Smart Grouping:** Neatly categorizes Tweaks, System Apps, and AppStore Apps right on the main Settings page.\n- **Optimized for Newer iOS:** Solves the issue of tweak preferences being buried deep within General settings on iOS 18 and above.\n- **Flexible Customization:** Enable/disable categories, rename labels, customize tweak category icons, and rearrange layouts easily.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
